; Captain Falcon — AttackLibrary.
; Frame data sourced from Super Smash Bros. Melee community documentation.
; Hitbox values from meleelight (MIT © Will Blackett) — github.com/schmooblidon/meleelight
;
; Kit philosophy: Slow but devastating. Every clean hit carries KO threat.
;   Jab        : frame 2 — fast poke. 80° angle keeps the opponent close for follow-up.
;   ForwardTilt: frame 9 — mid-range poke. Combo starter at low/mid % (Sakurai angle).
;   UpTilt     : frame 5 — anti-air. High BKB at 80° — juggle launcher above 60%.
;   ForwardSmash: frame 14 — slow but lethal. 20% kills ~90% mid-stage.
;   NeutralAir : frame 4 — aerial zoning. Mid-angle send for combo or edgeguard.
;   ForwardAir : frame 14 — the KNEE. 18% kill confirm at 80%+. The signature move.
;
; Character identity:
;   • Fastest run speed in the roster (820 px/s). Neutral is all dash-and-punish.
;   • Every move is slow. The read has to come BEFORE the commitment.
;   • ForwardAir (Knee) rewards deep reads: 14-frame startup, KO power at mid %.
;   • Weight (104) eats punishment — Falcon often wins the damage race if he can
;     land his hits.
[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="AttackLibrary" load_steps=18 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Scripts/Character/Combat/AttackLibrary.cs" id="Script_AttackLibrary"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Scripts/Character/Combat/AttackData.cs"    id="Script_AttackData"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Scripts/Character/Combat/HitboxData.cs"    id="Script_HitboxData"]

; ── Jab ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Melee Falcon Jab1: frame 2 active, FAF 17. Rapid 3-hit jab in source game;
; represented here as a single punch — fast, low-commitment option.
; 80° keeps opponent close and slightly above for a follow-up dash.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="HitboxData_Jab"]
script = ExtResource("Script_HitboxData")
Damage = 3.0
BaseKnockback = 20.0
KnockbackGrowth = 100.0
LaunchAngle = 80.0
AngleFlipsWithFacing = true
HitlagFrames = 2
HitstunFrames = 8
Type = 0
IgnoresDI = false
HitboxId = 0

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="AttackData_Jab"]
script = ExtResource("Script_AttackData")
AttackId = "Jab"
IsAerial = false
StartupFrames = 1
ActiveFrames = 2
RecoveryFrames = 14
HitboxNodeName = "JabHitbox"
Hitboxes = Array[Resource]([SubResource("HitboxData_Jab")])
HitstunMultiplier = 0.9

; ── ForwardTilt ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Melee Falcon FTilt: frame 9, FAF 32. Solid mid-range poke. 11% damage.
