; ── ForwardAir — THE KNEE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Melee Falcon FAir "Knee of Justice": frame 14 clean hit, FAF 44. SIGNATURE move.
; 18% clean hit at 32° — deep horizontal send. Kills at 80%+ mid-stage. The
; most iconic aerial in platform fighter history. 14-frame startup demands a hard read
; or following an air-release; the payoff is an uncontested edge kill confirm.
; IsAerial=true — aerial only. Land before or after, it must be committed in the air.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="HitboxData_ForwardAir"]
