; ── NeutralSpecial — FALCON PUNCH ────────────────────────────────────────────
; meleelight: 27% damage, 102 KBG, 30 BKB, Sakurai angle. THE read move.
; ~Frame 40 startup (Melee hits f53 — shortened for our faster pace) means it
; only lands off a hard read or a shield-break. Reuses the ForwardSmashHitbox
; node, extended by the smash hitbox placement. Usable airborne (true to Melee).
